window.products.push({"id":545028,"name":"Commollis 18x18 Bamboo Pillow Inserts Set of 2 Decorative Throw Pillows for Couch 18 Square Sofa Pillow for Living Room Cooling Euro Décor Pillow Inse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QsoqZckmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will receive two high quality throw pillow inserts that are good decorative pillow inserts for your living room. They are luxurious and exquisite pillow inserts that can accurately fit your pillow cover of the same size. We promise that you will fall in love with their smooth and comfortable feel! If they can match with your room style, you don’t even need to buy cases for them. Rather than renewing the whole pillow all the time, purchasing a premium insert and changing only the cover each time will be a more cost-effective option. We take great care to ensure that every insert is of exceptional quality, fit and comfort - plus they look wonderful. These pillow inserts will last much longer than normal synthetic cushion inserts, so you can enjoy your throw pillow for many years to come. Our bamboo pillow insert is the best way to keep your pillow clean, which is both long-lasting and breathable. We use only super-soft 100% Bamboo Viscose as the cover for our inserts and it fits perfectly into all of our pillow covers. The bamboo surface helps keep the contact surface between the insert and cover clean, ensuring that you don't need to wash the insert frequently and it won't pose any threat to your health. You can prepare a thin case in summer to enjoy the coolness of bamboo fiber when leaning on it, and put on a fuzzy or thick case to feel warm in winter. When you use a thin and light one, the blue piping inside may be faintly exposed, but this will not be the case when using the thick or dark one, providing more choice for you when matching your room style. Or you can just choose the pillows with white piping directly. These sofa pillows are filled with high-density filling, which makes them more fluffy and soft, and rebound quickly after you open the compressed package. When you lean or lie down on the sofa for reading, gaming or watching TV, these soft throw pillows could help you feel more comfortable. If you feel that there is too much filler, you can also choose to take out a certain amount of filler through the zipper to achieve a perfect state.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QsoqZckmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Commollis","source_asin":"B09L46DD87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L46DD87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L46DD87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
