window.products.push({"id":545136,"name":"MYNEX Presents 4 PC Sheet Set 100% Organic Cotton 800 TC Premium Sheet Set, Soft & Luxurious Long Staple Italian Finish Comfy Bedding Set Comes with 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":120.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517has2rinL._AC_SL1312_.jpg","description":"SET INCLUDES: 1 flat sheet(108X102), 1 fitted sheet(76X80X24), 2 pillowcases(20X40). Comes in an array of attractive colors to suit your bedroom decor. No matter what size or style you order, we are committed to ensure you that you will love your new sheets. Organic Quality sheets at a great value! These 4 piece sets exceed comfort expectations, and are at a lower price than other sheet sets. Get more bang for your buck. Our 4 piece sets provide more value and flair than all the rest. We encourage customers to reach out and contact the Mynex brand regarding your experience. We want you to be 100% satisfied with your purchase and we pride ourselves on offering the best customer service in the business. DEEP POCKET - Fully elasticized fitted sheet which provide 21-inch-deep pockets to accommodate both deep and pillow top mattresses. Please feel free to reach out to us. Gift For men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Those who love you will love this delicate gift and the comfortable sleep provided by this gift. EASY CARE - Machine wash in cold. Dries quick on tumble dry low. More durable Organic cotton. A portion of profit goes to charity, As a company it is our mission to create love and happiness in the lives of all we touch, That is why we donate a portion of proceeds from each purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517has2rinL._AC_SL1312_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYNEX","source_asin":"B07W86HGJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W86HGJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W86HGJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":545137,"name":"GIR Silicone Spoonula, Ultimate-11 IN, Lime","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+zOwGKtmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The GIR ultimate Spoonula is a spatula + spoon that does it all. This Spoonula has a sharp edge for scraping and precise scooping. A wide, extra-deep bowl for the really heavy stuff. And perfect flexibility at the blade. The solid silicone blade and handle prevent damage and won't scratch delicate cookware. This heavy-duty platinum silicone is heat resistant up to 550°f so it will not discolor, warp, melt, or chip. Our proprietary fiberglass core provides better heat resistance and longer life than cheap iron and stainless steel cores, which heat up the handle and degrade silicone quality. The unibody design is super hygienic - no holes or seams for food/oils to get caught in.. Dishwasher safe on any rack or extremely easy to clean by hand. Made to last forever in your kitchen and comes with a manufacturer's 100% lifetime satisfaction guarantee, no questions asked. GIR started with a simple mission: to revolutionize the spatula. We knew that if we designed a Product with carefully chosen materials, and uncompromising focus on quality, we would have something worth sharing with the world. Our “get it right” philosophy applies to a complete range of products that are beautiful, functional, and fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+zOwGKtmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GIR","source_asin":"B07SQBMWMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SQBMWMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SQBMWMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
