window.products.push({"id":545199,"name":"Colonial Ivory/Gold Floral Tapestry Rug Rug Size: 30\" x 50\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M89N7T8GL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A celebration of brilliant color and pattern defines the Ivory and Gold Tapestry Rug, which is inspired by the art of tapestry and made with a petit point hook technique. The bright floral, leaf and vine motif is wool with an all-cotton backing. With woven designs of grape clusters and a multicolored border, hues like pink, purple, gold, cocoa and cornflower blue make this rug welcome in any special room. Rug pad recommended (sold separately). Vacuum regularly. Professional cleaning recommended. Imported. Amazon.com This handmade, 100% New Zealand wool pile rug displays a tapestry of flowers, leaves, and berries in subtle shades of sage, blue, lavender, rose, and gold against an inner field of ivory surrounded by a gold background. Employing about 30 chrome-dye colors and looped petit point style with about 90 hooks per linear foot, the design sparkles with clarity and glows richly with color. A heavyweight, 100% cotton backing provides added durability and stability. The rug measures approximately 30 by 50 inches, though the precise size varies due to the nature of handmade work. Vacuum and spot clean the rug, and, if necessary, have it professionally cleaned. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M89N7T8GL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAS Oriental Rugs","source_asin":"B00004YLWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004YLWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004YLWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
