window.products.push({"id":545263,"name":"Digital Alarm Clock for Bedrooms Kitchen Office 3 Alarm Settings Radio Wood Desk Clocks - Cat Flower Bird","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uzurd9-wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification Material: PVC board and Wooden body Size: 6.2x3.8x0.9 inch You Will Get 1pcs LED clock, 1pcs TYPE-C interface data cable, 1pcs desktop support bracket, 1pcs instruction manual Multiple Uses Multiple Occasions: Decorative for office,classroom,school,home ,living room, kitchen ,bedroom etc. Perfect Gift: Time clock is the perfect gift for Christmas, birthdays, housewarmings, weddings, or any special occasion. Personal Customization If you want to customize your exclusive picture, please contact us before payment. Power Saving Mode This product adds voice control function. In the power saving mode, the time display will automatically turn off. When five high beeps are emitted, the time will be displayed and stay for 10 seconds to meet your need to understand the time and save energy to the greatest extent. In this mode, the battery life can reach 95 days. When the time is always on, it can last for more than 24 hours. Tips for Maintaining the Radio Alarm Clock 1. When using a charging port that uses a clock, you must turn on the power of the TYPE-C port. This design cannot be used as an additional power supply to avoid the embarrassment of occupying the interface 2. Use a 5V mobile phone charger that is not used at home to connect to the power source. 3. Use power saving mode to extend battery life","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uzurd9-wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ART VVIES","source_asin":"B08T668L8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T668L8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T668L8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
