window.products.push({"id":545265,"name":"quiqear Bamboo Shoe Rack, 1 Tier Shoe Rack Organizer, Stackable & Durable Shoe Shelf Holder, Free Standing Shoe Racks, Shoe Storage Organizer for Entr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ieSeBXGCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY BAMBOO: In keeping with Quiqear's vision of protecting the environment, the shoe rack is made from renewable and durable bamboo. Bamboo shoe racks are more eco-friendly than wooden shoe racks. Bamboo has a shorter growth cycle than wood. It has sustainable regeneration characteristics after felling, which is more in line with the low-carbon concept in the modern economy. STACKABLE DESIGN: The size of bamboo shoe rack is 27.2*11*6.2 inches. Each layer can hold 3 pairs of adult shoes. The height between the bottom of shoe shelf and the ground is 4.5 inches, which can put another layer of shoes and the sweeping robot can pass through. At the same time, using the design of stackable shoe rack, 1 tier shoe rack is stacked on 2 tier shoe rack to maximize the use of space to store shoes. SMALL SPACE STORAGE: The shoe stand is small and lightweight, so it is easy to move. In addition to being used as a shoe rack for entryway, it is very suitable as a shoe rack for closet and shoe organizers under the bed. It can also be used in student dormitories with limited space to meet the needs of students to store more shoes. At the same time, this small shoe rack can be used as a show rack, kitchen organizer, flower stand. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Our shoe shelf have special installation instructions and tools. Each layer of shoe stand is made of two bamboo boards. The bamboo boards and the bamboo boards are connected together by plastic buckles, which is convenient and easy to install. It can also be done easily by one person, no experience required. AFTER-SALES SERVICE: In the process of installing and using the shoe shelf, if you encounter any problems, please feel free to contact us. We will do our best to provide you with professional guidance. If there is any problem with the product quality, we can provide return and exchange service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ieSeBXGCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"quiqear","source_asin":"B09XGM5H54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XGM5H54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XGM5H54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
