window.products.push({"id":545326,"name":"Skytech 5310 Fireplace Remote Control System with Backlit LCD Touch Screen with Timer and Thermostat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41z8CziDsML.jpg","description":"The Skytech 5310 remote control system was developed to provide a safe, reliable, and user-friendly remote control system for gas heating appliances. The system can be operated thermostatically or manually from the transmitter. The system operates on radio frequencies (RF) within a 20' range using non-directional signals. The system operates one of 1,048,567 security codes that are programmed into the transmitter at the factory; the remote receiver's code must be matched to that of the transmitter prior to initial use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41z8CziDsML.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SkyTech","source_asin":"B009TAOR60","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009TAOR60","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009TAOR60","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":545327,"name":"Décor&More Out of This World Plush Fleece Throw Blanket (50 inches x 60 inches ) - Space Adventure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kaJC0XtSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring outer space to your home with this ultra soft fleece throw blanket. Measuring at 50\" x 60\", this novelty Fleece Throw will allow you to relax and unwind under its warm and comfort. Simply kick back on your couch, bed, sofa or chair and cuddle in on the ultra-soft cozy blankets. Purposefully light weight to meet your traveling needs. Stow it away in your backpack or luggage for ultimate comfort in a car, bus or plane. Perfect for snuggling with family while enjoying a hot cup of coffee or hot cocoa and watching television. Ultra soft material and elegant colors bring a calm and elegant touch to any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kaJC0XtSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Décor&More","source_asin":"B099KJPG8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KJPG8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KJPG8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":545328,"name":"30 Pcs Christmas Wooden Gift Tags Blank Wooden Decorative Hanging Ornaments Cutouts Crafts with 30 Pcs Twine Ropes for Kids Christmas Tree Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lNksaU8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gift Package:The item include 30pcs Christmas Wooden Slices with 30 Pcs twine ropes;These Wood Hanging Ornaments Cutouts are very fantastic for card making,embellishments,scrapbooking,decoupage,sign making and many other art and craft projects. Wooden Material and Smooth Surface - These Hanging Ornaments Cutouts Crafts are made of wood, lightweight and durable. These wooden christmas pendants, and both sides are sanded to a smooth finish ready to paint,signature,decorate,stain,or simply leave plain. Multiple Applications - These Natural wooden christmas design pendants fit for card making,embellishments,calendars,birthday and celebration boards,wood garland,painting projects,scrap booking,decoupage,sign making and many other art and craft projects.They also will be good props for house embellishment.Perfect Christmas tree decoration. Diy with Your Imagination - There are countless ways to personalize theseChristmas themed wooden slices.You can just string them up for parties, dances, ceremonies or any special occasion. The wooden christmas Gift Tags are fantastic crafts for wedding,engagement,Christmas,Thanksgiving,Halloween,Valentine's Day,Mother's Day,Father's Day or other party decoration. Satisfactory Guaranteed-The package is a 28*20cm box. We fully stand behind of our products. These wood chips come with a 12 month warranty. If you received broken or defective unit, please contact us any time, we will compensate you with free replacement or full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lNksaU8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YuQi","source_asin":"B07D9HSBHL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D9HSBHL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D9HSBHL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":545329,"name":"Pinzon Italian Cotton Percale Queen Sheet Set, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tW2SREwoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy luxuriously smooth cotton sheets without the bother of ironing, thanks to Dreamcotton by Mascioni. A patented invention, Dreamcotton has increased elasticity to provide an exceptionally silky feel and is designed to come out of the dryer almost wrinkle free with no shrinkage. Expertly made in Italy, this queen-sized set includes flat and fitted sheets, and two standard pillowcases. Each piece features 100 percent Dreamcotton with 210 threads per inch in a satisfying percale weave. The set is safe to clean at home in the washer and dryer. The fitted sheet is designed with 15-inch corners to fit deep mattresses, and it measures 60 by 80 inches. The flat sheet is 100 by 102 inches and each pillowcase is 20 by 30 inches. Also offered in full, king, and California king sizes, the sheets are fabulously versatile in two color choices: white and ivory. Accessorizing can't get any easier. For a great night's sleep, this set provides all the benefits of superior-quality cotton sheets without being high-maintenance. Fabric Definition Percale: Percale woven fabrics provide a clean, crisp, cool feel, a perfect match with bed linens. Percale weaves can be made of any fiber but are usually cotton or a cotton/polyester blend. The fibers are tightly woven in a plain weave, meaning the warp and weft threads cross each other one at a time. This one-over, one-under weave is what makes a fabric Percale. Percale clothing usually runs around 80 square (80 threads by 80 threads), or 160 threads per square inch. Heavy grades in higher counts are used for bed sheeting. Percale sheets are high quality, smooth, and soft, since the fibers comprising the thread are usually first combed (opened and cleaned of impurities) and carded (separated into individual, cleaned fibers). Percale sheets have a thread count of at least 180 threads per inch and commonly run to over 200 threads per inch. Percale sheeting was first made in 1876 by Wamsutta Mills in New Bedford, Massachusetts. Percale fabric is rugged and versatile, with many uses now in clothing, curtains, and bedding. History of the Textile Mill Founded in 1957 by young brothers Bernardo and Umberto Mascioni, the Mascioni textile factory is acclaimed worldwide for the design, creation, and production of superior fabrics. Initially the firm cut, sewed, and marketed silk scarves and cotton handkerchiefs, and went on to become the first company in Europe to print tablecloths and sheets with its own brand name. The brand became well known and sold in the best stores and boutiques all over Europe, such as Harrods in London, Galleries Lafayette in Paris, and Cesari in Rome. Today, Mascioni mainly operates in home textiles, but also works in the apparel and hi-tech fabric industries. They are experts in textile printing, dyeing, and finishing, and are credited for style and technological innovations, such as Vat printing, Dreamcotton, and Dreamlinen finishing. Mascioni uses only state-of-the-art equipment while respecting the environment and the safety of its employees. The waters used in the mill are treated and purified, and 40% is recycled in the manufacturing process. Mascioni power plants use up to 50% renewable fuels and filters 99% of the emissions generated by combustion. History of the Region The mill operates in the Lombardy region of northern Italy, in the city of Cuvio. The region has an historical background in textile production. The famous silks of Como and the cottons of the Varese area are internationally known. Many prestigious fashion brands originated in this area. Nearby is Italy's business capital, Milan, which is often considered the fashion capital of the world and the place for style, quality, and design innovation. Northern Italy is also the leading producer of rice in Europe, and Lombardy is home to one of the best rice-growing areas. It is used in such dishes as \"Risotto alla Milanese,\" a creamy dish of braised short-grain rice blended with meat stock, saffron, and cheese which, together with breaded veal cutlets (Veal Milanese), represents a true Milanese specialty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tW2SREwoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B000Q924R2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000Q924R2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000Q924R2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
