window.products.push({"id":545463,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 50 PCS LOCOTIMYO Non-stick Disposable Air Fryer Liners, A Silicone Brush, Oil-proof, Water-proof Baking Paper, Food ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718R0eri2EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Your Air Fryer Clean: With these disposable air fryer liners, you can effectively protect your fryer from food scraps, grease, and grime to keep it clean, no more tedious cleaning, save time and effort. These paper liners are a must-have if you hate cleaning up after baking! Best Air Fryer Helper: Including 50pcs disposable air fryer liners and a silicone brush. Sufficient quantities for daily use. No interfering with internal air circulation, the heat is generated by air circulation through the walls of the pan and will not be affected by the use of disposable paper liners. And has no effect on the taste of food. Healthy and Reliable Material: Our baking paper is made of unbleached food-grade parchment paper, it is non-stick, waterproof, oil-proof 100% healthy and has nice heat resistance, and can withstand temperatures up to 428°F. Easy to Use: These parchment paper for air fryer is designed round bowl shape, so you don't need to tear, fold, cut or bend it, and you can directly put it in when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge 4.5cm can protect the side of fryers and effectively prevents food or grease from sticking to it. It is lightweight so please always use it with enough food to weigh down the parchment. Widely Used: These baking parchment liners are suitable for air fryers, ovens, microwaves, steamers, etc. Paper liners can be used for baking, roasting, frying, or serving food. They can be used for camping, home baking, grilling, summer parties, etc. It's an indispensable baking supplies in your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718R0eri2EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOCOTIMYO","source_asin":"B09QG6WVLN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QG6WVLN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QG6WVLN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
