window.products.push({"id":545535,"name":"Bottomless Portafilter for Gaggia 58mm (Rosewood)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718L-D67s6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FIRJOY Bottomless Portafilter Gaggia What is a bottomless portafilter and what is it used for? Bottomless portafilters are used as a training tool. It will provide you with immediate feedback and can see if channeling occurs right away. Channeling is the rapid passage of water through fractures in the coffee puck, which produces a thinner, under-extracted espresso. When it occurs, you'll often see sudden appearances of blond streaks in the stream of espresso; sometimes the puck will even have pencil lead-sized holes where channeling occurred. With this 58mm naked portafilter, you'll be able to see the extraction in real time to understand if you're grinding and tamping correctly. If you want to improve your barista skills by using a visual aid to identify what you're doing wrong, this is the perfect tool. Specification: Item Type: Bottomless Portafilter Gaggia Material: 304 Stainless Steel + Wood Weight: 0.73lb Package includes: 1 x Bottomless Portafilter for Gaggia (BASKET INCLUDED) Note: * Only compatible with BABY, CAREZZA, CLASSIC, ESPRESSO DELUXE, EVOLUTION, EVOLUTION ESPRESSO, NEW BABY, NEW BABY 06 CLASSIC, NEW BABY DOSATA, NEW ESPRESSO 06, TEBE Key Product Features. * NOT compatible with Gaggia models after 2015 Key Product Features","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718L-D67s6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIRJOY","source_asin":"B09GLVJ2L9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GLVJ2L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GLVJ2L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
