window.products.push({"id":545548,"name":"Merry Christmas Banner Christmas Door Decorations Clearance,Christmas Front Porch Banners Decor for Outsides Buffalo Plaid Sign Santa Snowman Hanging ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714p1rkq3eL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Package Includes: One package contains two long Christmas banners. Each welcome front porch sign measures approximately 72 x 12 inches(LW)，perfect size for you to hang anywhere. Their vibrant colors will undoubtedly make your holiday decor look more festive! Buffalo Plaid Christmas Decorations: Our merry christmas signs use the classic red and black buffalo plaid design, printed with many Christmas-related elements, such as snowflakes, small gifts, Santa Claus, snowman and the words \"Merry Christmas\". Dressing up your house with these eye-catching hanging Christmas banners will definitely create a happy and warm Christmas atmosphere for your home. Well-Made Outside Banners: Christmas porch decorations are made of excellent 600D polyester Oxford fabric, which is wrinkle-resistant, study and durable. They can withstand the cold winter rainy nights and remain as new under the sun the next day. Easy to clean, machine washable, and will not fade. If stored properly, it can be used again the next year. Easy to Hang: Front door Christmas banners are equipped with poles and ropes at the top to help you hang them conveniently, and two grommets are specially designed at the bottom so that you can attach heavy objects to prevent them from swaying in the wind or keep them straight. If you hang the Christmas door decorations on the front door of the house, everyone passing by will notice them, and you will surely receive a lot of compliments from neighbors and friends. Wide Application: These plaid christmas decor banners are suitable both indoors and outdoors. Using them as decorations for Christmas parties and Christmas family gathering dinners will definitely add a lot of fun. You can hang these Santa Christmas Welcome signs on the door, wall, porch, fireplace, living room, yard, and any place you want to dress up. They are a great addition to farmhouse Christmas home decor and will brighten up your living space!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714p1rkq3eL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIALTODAY","source_asin":"B09DKDYDZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DKDYDZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DKDYDZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
