window.products.push({"id":545589,"name":"EHOMEA2Z Large Aluminum Pans (15 Pack) Full Size Deep Foil Disposable Durable Large Steam Table Pans for Baking Serving, Chafing Trays for Caterers, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tLZFgCuoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY - In simpler words you can rest assured that these pans are made from high-quality, food-grade aluminum. They're also disposable, so feel free to toss them once you're done using them. ALUMINUM FOIL PANS Sturdy pans, great for cooking, roasting or heating in the oven and serving straight to the table.Safe for use in freezer, oven, and steam table DURABLE BAKING PANS - These disposable aluminum pans are made of durable, lightweight aluminum that can withstand temperatures up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit! Plus, they're recyclable, so you don't need any cleaning products or pots/pans when you're done cooking- just throw them away after use (no rinse needed)! SUPERIOR HEAT CONDUCTIVITY Heats food evenly; withstands temperatures of up to 500 Fahrenheit SAFE for use in freezer, oven, and steam table","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tLZFgCuoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EHOMEA2Z","source_asin":"B07CCG61MY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CCG61MY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CCG61MY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
