window.products.push({"id":545591,"name":"Lorell Ergomesh 86000 Chair, 28.5D x 28.5W x 45H in, Black Mesh Back/Black Fabric Seat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s66dWRgmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Executive High-back Mesh Chair cradles you during a hard day at work with a breathable mesh back and mesh fabric seat. The ergonomic mesh back supports the natural curvature of your back for less strain during work at the computer or meetings at your desk. Multifunction control adjusts seat and back angles independently with two levers for infinite locking within a fixed range. For more individualized comfort, arms adjust in height and width, and the seat height from floor adjusts from 17\" to 21\". High-back chair also swivels 360 degrees and tilts with the pivot point located directly above the center of the chair base. Five-star nylon base is equipped with smooth-rolling casters for easily moving the chair where needed. Weight capacity is 275 lb. High-back chair is available in black frame only and meets the CA117 fire-retardant standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s66dWRgmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lorell","source_asin":"B075SWXLZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075SWXLZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075SWXLZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":545592,"name":"SatiSouk Pizza Peel 12-inch x 14-inch - Aluminum Metal Pizza Peel with Wooden Foldable Handle - Metal Rocker Blade Cutter, Professional Pizza Server A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1d2PhEuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1- ⭐ Premium Quality: SatiSouk Pizza Peel 12 inch by 14 inch is made of commercial grade aluminum with an adjustable rubberwood handle, making it rust-proof. The 2mm thick peel slides effortlessly under the dough. Did someone say, “More Cheese”? Well, we got you covered, our light-weight handle will provide a light, but firm grip and the handle lock ensures the peel never bends even on the heaviest pies. It comes with a blue film to protect the peel from scratches during shipment. 2- ⭐ Tidy up your kitchen: No more clutter on the kitchen counter. Our pizza paddle comes with an aluminum knob, which makes it occupy even less storage space, all you gotta do is loosen up the knob, fold the handle, and put it in the cupboard/drawer. Better yet, you can even hang it by the string on the handle, the minimal design will only increase your kitchen’s aesthetic 3- ⭐ Easy to use: Sprinkle a pinch of corn flour before putting a wet dough on the pizza spatula to ensure a non-stick experience and the extended handle gives it a length of 25”, making sure to protect against burns or for deep pizza ovens. Remember, don’t use it as a pizza cutting board or you will end up damaging the peel and the blade 4- ⭐ Rocker Style Pizza Cutter: Worried about chopping that 14” pie evenly? We got your back. SatiSouk also offers a stainless-steel Rocker Style Pizza Cutter with a sharp, non-flimsy blade cutting nice and crisp slices for everyone. Just rock it on the hot pizza and the crispy clean slices will speak for themselves. The cutter comes with a durable plastic cover for safe storage. 5- ⭐ Easy to Clean: Done with the pizza party? Don’t worry about cleaning because our pizza peel is super easy to clean. Just handwash the peel with a sponge to make sure no sticky crumbs are left and to ensure your safety, pop the cutter in the dishwasher and off you go, but don’t forget to put the plastic cover on the cutter for safe storage. After all, “from dough to cheese, we aim to please.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1d2PhEuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SatiSouk","source_asin":"B09FLNP5JJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLNP5JJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLNP5JJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
