window.products.push({"id":545594,"name":"Chelsea Clock Patriot Deck Clock, 6\" Black Dial, 7 3/4” Dia. X 3\" Depth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qld2Y54RL._AC_.jpg","description":"WWII-Era Design – The Patriot Deck Clock is based on an original Chelsea Clock design for a WWII Navy engine room deck clock. Military Time – Both 12-hour and 24-hour time formats are displayed on the easy-to-read six-inch black dial. Weather-Resistant – Made with phenolic, a durable, heat-resistant resin, this boating instrument is designed to last for decades. Exceptional Accuracy – The quartz movement ensures that you get reliable timekeeping, and a second hand is included for added precision. Easy Adjustments – The clock can be quickly adjusted after mounting by using the hinged bezel and brass screw-bolt lock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qld2Y54RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chelsea Clock","source_asin":"B00IDA7C0U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IDA7C0U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IDA7C0U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
