window.products.push({"id":545636,"name":"Lake House #2 Stemless Wine Glasses (Set of 4) (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WQrhuhtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sip your favorite wine in style with our must have personalized wine glasses. Featuring the trendy stemless design, these wineglasses are perfect for all occasions, from sophisticated soirees, to weeknight dinners alike.The set includes 4 stemless wine glasses that will be custom engraved with your design. Each glass holds 17 oz and measure 4.5\"H x 3.375\"W.You can have all four glasses engraved with the same design or you can customize and personalize each glass individually - the choice is yours!!Our customization system makes it easy for you to design each glass. You can engrave your glasses with Name/Text, Name & Initials, Monograms (many styles available) or even graphics and text. We have a huge collection of fonts and graphics for you to choose from. If you are unable to find what you are looking for, please contact us and we will do our best to accommodate your needs.Design Shown: Lake House #2 (#1018278)Features:==================================== * Available in multiple personalization styles, fonts, shapes & graphics * Same or different personalization on each of the glasses - the choice is yours! * Set of 4 laser engraved glasses * Stemless bases provide stability and aesthetic appeal * Each glass holds 17 oz and measure 4.5\"H x 3.375\"W * Clear Glass * Dishwasher Safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WQrhuhtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B0764JXWMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0764JXWMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0764JXWMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":545637,"name":"SmartSeat Dining Chair Cover and Protector (Midnight Navy Blue), Removable, Waterproof, Machine Washable, Stain Resistant, Soft, Comfortable Fabric fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tJCTENU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The SmartSeat chair protector is the better way to protect your dining room and kitchen chairs from stains and spills. The SmartSeat chair protector is a waterproof, stain resistant and machine washable cover. It provides the same protection as vinyl covers with the benefits of soft and comfortable fabric. The cover is easy to use and fits most chair styles and sizes. Adjustable straps securely attach the cover to your chair. Use it at mealtime, for arts and crafts or leave it on for a clean and attractive look. Available in five wonderful colors: Sandstone Tan, Chocolate Brown, Metro Black, Burgundy Red and Midnight Navy Blue.   SmartSeat chair cover can be used with kids, pets, the elderly and even in office environments. They are attractive enough to leave on your chairs when entertaining adults or can be used to give old chairs a fresh new look.   Our designers handpicked five colors that match almost any look wherever you use them. We do not offer patterns because they are hard to match to different upholstery and room decor. Rest assured! Our colors won’t bleed onto your clothes or your chairs and will withstand the test of repeated washing. Our world class color dying process keeps the color in the cover.   Fit will vary based on size and style of chair. Optimal fit requires a chair with legs (as opposed to a center pole, as with a swivel office chair) or back rails around which the cover can be secured. While the cover will adequately protect chair upholstery on small chairs, the cover will not fit as snuggly as it does on larger chairs.   We are available by email to assist customers in obtaining a snug and attractive fit on chairs of most sizes and styles.   Applicable shipping charges if any are non-refundable for undelivered, unclaimed or refused packages unless we made an error. (U.S. Patent No. 8,414,071)   THE PRICE IS FOR A SINGLE COVER.   En Espanol: Cubierta removible de silla de comedor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tJCTENU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartSeat Chair Protector","source_asin":"B0047WI6S0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0047WI6S0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0047WI6S0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
