window.products.push({"id":545912,"name":"Casket Etcetera Faith Cremation Jewelry Cross Urn Stainless Steel Pendant for Memorial, Keep Your Love Ones Ashes Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v3hlBF4gL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"This \"Cremation Urn Necklace\" remembrance jewelry opens and allows you to place a small amount of cremated remains inside. A remembrance necklace is used as a remarkable way to memorialize a lost loved one, therefore helping you keep a part of your loved one with you at all times. Which helps to cherish the memory of a life well lived. It can also be used to hold crushed flowers, a lock of hair, dirt or sand from a memorable location, or any other tiny object you want to keep close to your heart. Remembrance jewelry is a way of symbolizing the belief that, one is truly \"gone but not forgotten\" can be engraved. Hand crafted urn necklace, cremation jewelry. Free 20 inch chain: Width: 2mm stainless steel chain, filling kit and purple velvet gift box included. High polished shiny surface, sturdy solid links of the chain ensures its sturdiness and also will not pull your hair. Select healthy and durable stainless steel as material, hypoallergenic, lead free and nickel free.100% water resistant. This jewelry can either be worn or displayed at your home in an elegant display dome or jewelry box. It is a growing trend nowadays to hold a small portion of the cremated remains of a deceased in a piece of cremation jewelry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v3hlBF4gL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casket Etcetera","source_asin":"B01A7JTKZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A7JTKZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A7JTKZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
