window.products.push({"id":545968,"name":"Topulors Manual Food Chopper Hand-Powered Food Chopper Compact Handheld Onion Chopper, Garlic Squeezer, Ginger Slicer, Pepper Cut, Herbs Chop, Cheeses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t+5q3JcIL._AC_SL1336_.jpg","description":"Do you ever wished there's something that can take the hard work out of chopping vegetables and fruits? Or ever wondered how to NOT get watery eyes while cutting onions? If so, then our Topulors Food Chopper is your answer! This versatile tool makes quick work out of tough cutting tasks, and it is easy to assemble, use and store. If you hate getting watery eyes when chopping onions, this will solve it all for you. With the lid on top and the onions kept inside of the bowl, you can effortlessly chop away without making your eyes watery. It is the quick and easy way to chop fruits, vegetables, nuts, and herbs or create fresh salsas, pestos, coleslaws, salads in just seconds.   ✶ Powerful & Versatile: Perfect for slicing vegetable salads, chopping nuts, herbs, veggies, pesto, hummus, salsa, guacamole, boneless meat, and more. ✶ Compact & Safe to Use: Great for small kitchens, RVs, travel and camping. Made from BPA-free plastic.  ✶ Easy to Clean: Blades, bowl and storage lid are top-rack dishwasher safe. Components come apart for easy cleaning.  ✶ Convenient: Makes food preperation fun and easy. Just pull the cord a few times to to chop/mince/blend your ingredients.  ✶ Designed for a Perfect Chopping Job: Features sharp stainless steel blades for fast chopping, comfort soft grip lid, anti-skid base, easy pull cord, large handle for easy leverage.  The chopper is design with a cord pulling powered cutting rotator with 3 ultra-sharp stainless steel blades. There are so much to do during the day, cooking needs to be done fast. The Topulors Food Chopper is a versatile and indispensable kitchen tool that makes cooking quicker, easier, and more fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t+5q3JcIL._AC_SL1336_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPULORS","source_asin":"B07GP939GL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-545968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GP939GL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GP939GL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
